      "description": "<p>Added more items to loadout generation pool:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Latest gear from <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2239/couturier-gear-and-clothing-pack\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Couturier</a> (2.0.2)</li>\n<li>More parts from <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1263/epics-all-in-one\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">EpicsAIO</a></li>\n<li>Wolfik’s <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/1569/wolfiks-heavy-trooper-masks-reupload\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">HeavyTroopers</a> (FDE and Black)</li>\n<li>WIP: <a target=\"_blank\" class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/2451/echoes-of-tarkov-requisitions-ng\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">EoT Requisitions NG</a> - a few parts and 2 guns (Ak-15, Ak-19) rn</li>\n</ul>\n<hr />\n<p>No code changes. If you don’t have any of those mods there is no sense to update from 2.0.3. However, if you’re still on 2.0.0-2.0.2 version I recommend updating regardless since there have been code fixes in 2.0.3.</p>\n",
